  "story": {
    "day": 108,
    "title": "Kaya's Ninetieth Birthday Surprise",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was ready for her grandma's ninetieth birthday.",
      "She took a cold bath, then put on her shirt and skirt.",
      "She went shopping at the mall to buy a cake.",
      "At the entrance, she saw two cent coins near a shoe.",
      "On the street, Kaya did not litter; she walked straight.",
      "Back home, she helped cut the cake in the living room.",
      "Her grandma sat on the sofa, holding a religious book.",
      "\"Excuse me,\" Kaya said, \"I have a gift to give.\"",
      "Grandma laughed; she did not want the day to break.",
      "Kaya had to write a card about an island.",
      "Her new jeans lay near the tennis court; she would wait.",
      "She hoped her plant would not die before she could turn to sleep."
    ]
  }
